Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.38,0:00:03.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,相當有感覺　無敵的POWER！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:06.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感覺不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:09.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:13.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,來　向著明天前進吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:27.44,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,只要接觸就能了解　心的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:30.85,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:34.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes! Change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:37.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,激烈的戰鬥　不管多少次都要嘗試！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.85,0:00:41.15,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,貫徹真實
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:44.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,驚險刺激最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:54.93,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣開始照亮世界的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.93,0:01:00.88,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,充滿你給予的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:07.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,將不似任何人的笑容作為榮耀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.91,0:01:12.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,現在超越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:16.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,We can try over the future world!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.81,0:01:17.19,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:18.59,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,最大 !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.68,0:01:21.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,大膽 !
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.79,0:22:16.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:16.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:36.97,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在你面前的話　你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.57,0:22:44.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連超能力也派不上用場
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.39,0:22:50.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連畢達哥拉斯　也無法弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:53.18,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛是智慧之輪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.55,0:23:00.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,一副要哭的樣子　低著頭是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:05.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有笑容　才能產生奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.05,0:23:07.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,DA DA 命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.52,0:23:07.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,啾啾 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:08.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想把你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:09.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨嗨 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:13.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,變成大膽無敵的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.13,0:23:17.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人無比沉醉　這是真的　絕對的 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:18.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,DA DA 大變身
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.56,0:23:18.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,啾啾 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:19.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.86,0:23:20.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨嗨 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:25.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,爆炸性的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.46,0:23:28.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能喜歡　絕對 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.25,0:23:33.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:38.47,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必須要去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.89,0:01:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在馬上去救皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們也去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.13,0:01:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵！紫穗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼回來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.95,0:01:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這還用問嗎  當然是超能力者的直覺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就能知曉同伴的危機的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.43,0:01:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀～  內褲被皆本先生洗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:02:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是因為爸爸突然有了緊急工作  所以就回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.79,0:02:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經嫁不出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不著這麼誇張吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.53,0:02:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之  既然她這麼「好心」留下了地圖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要盡快對皆本說不要洗女士的內褲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  既然這樣那就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(670,570)\fad(500,500)}24th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(770,600)\fad(500,500)}「專業主夫！被洗了…！」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是兵部的同夥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是那傢伙的命令嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.49,0:02:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是煩人的老頭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是不閉嘴的話我就把你的嘴給堵上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對這種貨色言聽計從的傢伙居然是女王  真讓人不爽！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能容忍我的少佐被這樣的傢伙給奪走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…「我的少佐」？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你…你知道自己在說些什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒吧！  那種變態老頭…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:03:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是敢再說少佐的壞話  小心我把你的鼻子也給堵上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那傢伙是變態這點是確實無誤的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個由我幫你保管  為了不讓你做出多餘的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說在前頭  如果她逃掉了或者去找同伴幫忙的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就沒命了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這幫傢伙究竟是何方神聖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  到底在哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算這雙鞋是配合你的能力製作的  也是有極限的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要隨便浪費體力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.69,0:03:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過真是糟糕的地圖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.59,0:03:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個巴士站的標記好像關東煮一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙是笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不但字很骯髒  而且盡是錯誤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰看得懂這東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣的  讓我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們很睏吧  基本都沒怎麼睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒…沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒是賢木醫生你看出些什麼來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  從這裡往南二十公里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相當深的山啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這樣的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔～  狀態不太好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該還要花不少時間的  你們稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本並不希望你們戰鬥的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骯髒的工作就由我來做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是某處的廢校
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子是在這裡生活的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個女的似乎還沒來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children今晚才會回家的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前她們是看不到你的留言的  也無法聯絡上她們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗬  也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:33.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要她來了我就將她擊敗就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要哪個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早餐啊  味精口味和咖哩口味你要哪個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.86,0:05:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你…一日三餐都是吃這種東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是蔬菜  給我吃蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會變成這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要將攝取過多的鹽分和添加物排出體內
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的味覺變遲鈍了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃太多重口味的東西和刺激物了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我好好記住素材的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些在午餐和晚餐的時候用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放在那裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.79,0:06:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  不要把蔥挑出來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要全都吃完
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.51,0:06:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼啊  從剛才開始就這麼拽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白自己的立場嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人質吧？  所以我沒有逃嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總…總之我不吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎～  這樣好嗎～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒身高  皮膚和頭髮都乾巴巴的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,容易疲勞感冒  肚子裡全都是腸內有害細菌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的女孩子是兵部的喜好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.20,0:07:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一靠近就變得不可愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮膚和頭髮都乾巴巴  而且好像還有臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小個子是無所謂的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是變態嘛  但是這個樣子啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就此別過  走吧  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣  這樣好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  絕對不要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其…其他呢  其他還有什麼需要改善的地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我  現在就全部告訴我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好燙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  感覺讓人提不起勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,替換的衣服和毛巾我就放在這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  明明是女孩子卻居然整整五天沒有換衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:07:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了  耳朵後面也要好好洗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  待會見
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙是怎麼回事啊…  真的是男人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該不會其實是大媽吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不做了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好柔軟  而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好聞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真和平啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣子都快讓人忘記自己是被囚禁的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…這是不可能的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  我能提問嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子是從什麼時候起住這裡的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有家人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那除了你之外和她在一起的大人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊  一定是發生了很多事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什麼啊  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在敵人這也當主夫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  這傢伙的能力不明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃了一驚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是配合我的能力設置的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的能力和下一步動作全都被我看穿了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山田惟光
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原先在專門負責紛爭地域的民間警備公司工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡單說就是傭兵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是在戰鬥中負傷之後…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精神感應？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為被知曉了過去而發火了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這條兵部養的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,負傷後失去了受信能力的精神感應能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.49,0:10:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收留你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.27,0:10:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就只有那傢伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐是為了超能力者的未來而戰的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,託少佐的福  我能夠像這樣站在正義的戰場上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正義？  你說兵部是正義？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙可是超能力者犯罪史上最恐怖的罪犯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他救了澪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也察覺到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪原本是生存在怎樣的環境中的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在被少佐保護之前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.81,0:10:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子連表情都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最終對於普通人來說超能者只是怪物或方便的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐為了拯救這樣的孩子們而創立了組織
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,組織？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  為了解放超能力者的革命組織
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20}P.A.N.D.R.A{\r}\N潘多拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,P.A.N.D.R.A？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:11:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼九具津和肌肉也是P.A.N.D.R.A的成員？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不然你們也入伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}胴が長い{\r}\N身軀很長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}一緒だぞ{\r}\N一起哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以特別為你們拜託少佐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗬  換了衣服意外的可愛嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心中不禁垂涎三尺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫…紫穗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  打擾到你們了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.71,0:11:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵？！  那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我當然也在的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹嘛和來找我幹架的女人這麼親密啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  不…不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果還是來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我反省
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:12:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是帶同伴來了啊  那麼就在這裡將全員…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摧毀！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分身了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  從誰開始收拾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  把限制器
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什麼時候把那個拿回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  在你入浴的時候我就拿回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.83,0:12:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者  The Children  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有想要守護的人  不管前方是否有危險在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:33.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使拚盡性命也要竭力守護
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人們將其稱為超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惟光
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊那兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.82,0:12:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為用瞬移能比得過我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是這麼認為的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於部分瞬移
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要更高一籌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:12:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧  並不是被切斷了的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和身體是好好連著的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我的腳還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎麼做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住…住手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身為超能力者居然使用這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,燃料還剩一點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電池也能夠使用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,油壓挖土機  產商大松
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,型號PC120-5
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機械質量 11700kg
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鏟斗標準容量  0.5立方公尺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為你…注入生命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比想像中的能幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.13,0:14:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種蠻力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本沒辦法和我一決勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼女王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你這種傢伙成為女王還想要什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  怎麼辦  怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該為哪邊加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是站在哪邊的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬眠模式
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你這懦夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.51,0:14:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  我說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的動作我已經全都看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是身體生疏了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟不上動作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就沒意義了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  這沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要勉強  你的傷也還沒好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對你來說負擔太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險  賢木
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逼不得已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  雖然看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你逼不得已要做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你這種人…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  等等  怎麼回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我站住  你這混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木  這裡拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要弄壞我的摩托車
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:34.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼輕…並不是只因為沒有上半身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,形勢逆轉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.55,0:15:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招  我的必殺奧義
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻醉劑靜脈注射
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這只不過是麻醉…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,施展完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於回來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別想逃走  你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  你們兩人一起變成風吧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  為什麼要連我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.02,0:16:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙突然沒力了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.59,0:16:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且漸漸變得稀薄了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.37,0:16:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分身一號？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以Children為對手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用分身戰鬥的負擔太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人格暴走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去  你也會被那傢伙給吸收的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.09,0:16:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經不需要你這傢伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是本體
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.14,0:16:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了  給我回來  馬上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋  我已經支配了三分之二了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要消失的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:16:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又沒什麼所謂的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.69,0:17:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你其實也是想讓自己消失的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有任何人會守護你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起你來  少佐也要更重視女王
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算打倒了女王  你也是無法得到她所擁有的東西的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是家  家人  朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有戀人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.17,0:17:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這世上沒有你的容身之處
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要堅定信念
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辦不到  因為那傢伙說的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是事實啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎樣都無所謂嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼  就因為有這力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這力量不好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼  為什麼只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回來吧！  你也不是孤身一人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  小薰你明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙是來找你幹架的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼呢  只要看到沮喪的超能力者我就急得慌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:19:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而在這種時候不知為何力量會源源不斷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Psychic{\r}\N念動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殘像百烈拳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了  變回一個人了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.99,0:19:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然遍體鱗傷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:33.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為分身被打得很慘
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.61,0:19:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  這麼拽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你這種人…像你這種人…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再分出勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:20:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算天地倒轉我也不承認你是女王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  振作的真快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:03.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了  少佐是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很快就會超越你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  給我站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  完全消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像把大漢也帶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  真是讓人火大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次見面我決不輕饒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗  有什麼線索嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.52,0:20:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,線索…  啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子穿著皆本先生洗好的內褲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的晚餐是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想吃蛤仔醬湯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是災難啊  皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平安無事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  那幫傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這身傷是你自作自受
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.69,0:20:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過兵部看來果然在策劃著什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潘多拉的全貌  女王的意義
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要盡快解明才行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.97,0:20:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.43,0:21:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君  怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果B.A.B.E.L.能早點保護那孩子的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也有可能會成為Children中的一員
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.23,0:21:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得女王如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  那種傢伙沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那傢伙可以的話  那我也能夠擔任女王的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不是孤身一人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  不要待在那廢屋裡  到同伴身邊來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你希望的話  我也會讓你接受教育的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.43,0:21:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微有些拘束也是能夠忍耐的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  同伴！同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.15,0:22:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  那麼走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.94,0:23:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.43,0:23:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個孕婦好像感到困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是感到悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.33,0:23:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  嬰孩誕生不是值得開心的事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.00,0:23:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽把我生下來是覺得開心的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.46,0:23:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理所當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.26,0:23:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是超能力者也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.25,0:23:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這麼問
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.93,0:23:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是很開心的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:23:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.01,0:24:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第25話  「安產祈願！你好、小嬰孩」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.47,0:24:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也對你們生下來感到很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.96,0:24:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

